  "ingredients": [
    "5 sweet potatoes, peeled and sliced",
    "0.5 cup packed brown sugar",
    "0.25 cup reduced-fat margarine",
    "3 tablespoons orange juice",
    "1 pinch ground cinnamon",
    "1 (10.5 ounce) package miniature marshmallows"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients, and preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GzD66jjuoBESqNpS929905kU3jA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-13478-sweet-potato-casserole-ii-step-01-27d09c0c65a84dc1804998f1388df082.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13478/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place sweet potatoes in a large saucepan with enough water to cover. Bring to a boil and cook until tender, about 15 minutes. Remove from heat, drain, and mash.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jzsky-W2Vt6y094zEMspRsGrDq8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-13478-sweet-potato-casserole-ii-step-02-401474eeb7f244f6a32429a889414f27.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13478/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place mashed sweet potatoes in a large bowl. Add brown sugar, butter, orange juice, and cinnamon; mix with an electric mixer until blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lGVJYd-yFab02oweMmyIhnTjDs0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-13478-sweet-potato-casserole-ii-step-03-55278bcc6add4bee83eecfc612ed52ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13478/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread evenly into a 9x13-inch baking dish. Sprinkle marshmallows over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GMN8Ce7VNRKaBqc2C33v2B1MJEs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-13478-sweet-potato-casserole-ii-step-04-c4bb7c04028a4837a6c1c4fadf044307.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13478/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until casserole is heated through and marshmallows are puffed and golden brown, 25 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qHRCvcnxPHtElO3c8eEh-cXhBZs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-13478-sweet-potato-casserole-ii-step-05-b72a013692524a69a856c38cc5a6efbd.jpg"
